      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Google has a neat feature. If u enter “2pm utc” for example, It will directly show the converted time for your time zone. \nSo you could just plan with that or what ever time zone you like. Creating a new time zone wouldn’t solve anything as you would need to know how to convert to every other time zone.\nDon’t invent the wheel again and just stick to existing stuff.",
